{"ref":"BDB, פָּסֵחַ","hw":"פָּסֵחַ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פָּסֵחַ</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>limper</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  in Judah <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.12\">1 Ch 4:12</a>, Βεσσηε, Φεσση, etc.<br><strong>2.</strong>  head of post-ex. family <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:49\" href=\"/Ezra.2.49\">Ezr 2:49</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:50\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.50\">Ne 7:51</a>, Φισον, etc., 𝔊L Φασσα.<br><strong>3.</strong>  father of wall-builder <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:6\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.6\">Ne 3:6</a>, Φασεκ, Φεσσε.","next":"BDB, פִּסֵּחַ","prev":"BDB, פָּסַח²"}